<urn:atm:triage:finding/FNX-009>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "FNX-009" ;
  triage:title "CDR-007's revision newtypes leave three design docs stale; boundaries.md missing the new sqlite manifest" ;
  triage:description "fenix's independent critical review of PR #1395 reports CDR-007 changed expected_revision to Option<TaskRevision> and revision to TaskRevision (task_command.rs, task_mutation.rs, task_state.rs), but docs/plans/phase-az/sprint-AZ.2-task-domain-storage.md:158, sprint-AZ.3-task-command-handoff.md:111, and docs/task-lifecycle-schema.md:44 still declare the old Option<u64> signature -- the same doc-drift class CDR-006 was filed for. Separately, docs/atm-rusqlite/boundaries.md was correctly repaired for ARCH-006, but its 'Canonical machine-readable boundary sources' list covers only 7 of 18 manifests in boundaries/atm-storage-rusqlite/ and omits the new async-task-scheduler-audit-store-sqlite.toml this PR authors. Recommendation: update the three declared signatures, and either add the new manifest to boundaries.md or scope its heading to 'the adapters documented below'." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-az" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:category "documentation-consistency" ;
  triage:severity "minor" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
